  "EcommerceGo SaaS introduces a versatile PDF Voucher Module designed to streamline the distribution of coupon codes. This feature empowers merchants to manage and distribute promotional coupons efficiently, enhancing their marketing efforts and customer engagement. By leveraging this module, businesses can boost sales and attract new customers with minimal effort.": "EcommerceGo SaaS представляет универсальный модуль ваучеров PDF, предназначенный для оптимизации распространения кодов купонов. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Посмотреть живую демонстрацию",
  "User-Friendly Coupon Request Process": "Удобный процесс запроса купона",
  "The PDF Voucher Module simplifies the process for users to request coupon codes. Customers can easily submit a query for a coupon code directly through the EcommerceGo platform. This intuitive process ensures that customers can take advantage of promotional offers without any hassle, fostering a positive shopping experience and encouraging repeat business.": "Модуль PDF-ваучеров упрощает пользователям процесс запроса кодов купонов. ",
  "Admin Control and Approval": "Административный контроль и одобрение",
  "Upon receiving a coupon code request, the module notifies the admin, who can then review and approve the request. EcommerceGo SaaS provides a streamlined interface for admins to manage these requests efficiently. Once approved, the system automatically generates a PDF containing the coupon codes. This automated process minimizes the administrative burden, allowing businesses to focus on other critical aspects of their operations.": "При получении запроса кода купона модуль уведомляет администратора, который затем может просмотреть и одобрить запрос. ",
  "Automated PDF Generation and Distribution": "Автоматизированное создание и распространение PDF-файлов",
  "After the admin approves a coupon request, the PDF Voucher Module takes over, generating a professional-looking PDF document with the requested coupon codes. This document is then sent directly to the user’s email. The automation of this process ensures that customers receive their coupon codes promptly, enhancing their satisfaction and encouraging them to make a purchase. The professional format of the PDF also reflects positively on the business, reinforcing its credibility.": "После того, как администратор одобрит запрос купона, модуль PDF-ваучера вступит во владение, создав профессионально выглядящий PDF-документ с запрошенными кодами купонов. ",
